  // 616 threads compute 9856 outputs: each thread handles four adjacent
  // spatial locations (dx..dx+3) for four output channels (16 outputs per
  // thread). The 11x28 CTA tile keeps the same per-thread register
  // blocking while covering the 55 output columns with only two x-tiles
  // (56 padded columns, ~2% waste vs 64 padded columns, ~16% waste).
